-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/pages/the-bicister-village/Bicister-banner-1920x600.ashx?h=600&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=1bd77e56e3e6431090247619921c6bee&amp;hash=E1FB2B97D49394172D590797529BE54C\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"1f2b1c1a-43db-43c9-9b2a-5e9d01ae0449\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">The Bicester Collection</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><h2 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"UpdateHeading ng-star-inserted\">The thrill of discovery starts here </h2><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\"><p>The Bicester Collection brings together nine shopping Villages close to some of Europe’s most dynamic cities: London, Paris, Barcelona, Madrid, Milan, Brussels, Munich, Frankfurt, and Dublin. Unhurried and deeply immersive, each Village is shaped by the heritage, flavors, and artisanship of the region it calls home – a living celebration of local culture, world-class gastronomy, and the finest fashion and lifestyle brands.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nIn beautifully curated boutiques, heritage houses sit alongside emerging designers, with year-round savings of up to 60%, often more. Personalized services lend a quiet ease to the experience.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nEvery visit is elevated by personalised services and world-class gastronomy: a living celebration of culture, discovery, and the finest fashion and lifestyle brands.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Explore our <a href=\"https://www.thebicestercollection.com/en/campaign/editorial-city-guide-and-curated-travel-itinerary-across-europe/\">curated destinations</a> and start planning your visit.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inser